              "value": "For The Queen!"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "(olfactory)\n\nThe red commander ant gives a pheromone signal to spur other ants into a fury.\n\nAll ants within 30 feet who can smell this signal gain a +1 status bonus to attack rolls, reduce their frightened condition to 0, and are immune to the frightened condition for 1 minute."
